{"sentences":[{"id":"s_work_clt_49_1","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_49","textTraditional":"一、二十年，春，王二月，夫人姜氏如莒。","sentenceOrder":1},{"id":"s_work_clt_49_2","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_49","textTraditional":"婦人既嫁不踰竟，踰竟非正也。","sentenceOrder":2},{"id":"s_work_clt_49_3","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_49","textTraditional":"二、夏，齊大災。","sentenceOrder":3},{"id":"s_work_clt_49_4","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_49","textTraditional":"其志，以甚也。","sentenceOrder":4},{"id":"s_work_clt_49_5","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_49","textTraditional":"三、秋，七月。","sentenceOrder":5},{"id":"s_work_clt_49_6","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_49","textTraditional":"四、冬，齊人伐我。","sentenceOrder":6}],"overrides":{}}